## Global Rule Instructions

1. .md file operation requires reading docs/md/md-operations.md first. No exceptions.

2. Git operations → read docs/git/git-workflow-standard.md first. No exceptions.

3. Git gh operations → read docs/git/git-gh-operations.md first. No exceptions.

4. Cross-layer / call-direction work → read `docs/architecture/arch-layer-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

5. UI-layer changes → read and follow `docs/architecture/ui-layer-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

6. UI build (business-layer copy) → read and follow `docs/biz/ui-build-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

7. Workbench frontend / Tauri invoke / ACL → read and follow `docs/architecture/workbench-coding-discipline.md`. No exceptions.

8. Unit tests (Rust / JS / TS) → read and follow `docs/test/unit-test-principles.md`. No exceptions.
